2 CONT ..Gabriel Gabrielsen deres Søn ug 1862 Høilands Pr
2 CONT ..Kirsten Christine Gabrielsd.* deres Søn ug 1865 Høilands Pr
2 CONT In addition from 1875 census:
2 CONT Gabriel Gabrielsen b.1868 and Eneval Gabrielsen b.1871.
2 CONT
