1 NAME Johannes Eileivsen /Sundvor/
2 GIVN Johannes Eileivsen
2 _MARNM Sundvor
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1745
2 PLAC Sundvor, Bjerkreim, Rogaland
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 22 JUL 1830
2 PLAC Sundvor, Bjerkreim, Rogaland
