2 CONT Knut Svendsson probably lived at Nordre Hidle in Sjernar�y before
2 CONT moving back to �vre Bj�rheim around 1615.  He was called "young Knut
2 CONT Bj�rheim" in the early 1600s.  Knut paid tax as a farm renter from
2 CONT 1617 to 1644.  In 1647, Knut was operating a large farm of 2 laup 16
2 CONT merker sm�r.  After that he was named as a landowner who paid allodial
2 CONT taxes up to 1652.  His heirs paid allodial taxes in 1660.
2 CONT Knut was fined in 1621 for fighting with Ingebret Tau, who was fined
2 CONT as well.
